bdr:NT0C9290BEA127526D
   a             bdo:Note ;
   bdo:noteText  "teacher/student lineage dpal mgon bran du gtad pa bram ze nag po 'i man ngag gi rjes gnang, Pha bong gsan yig, v. 1, pp..157\nGsung 'bum in 4 volumes.\nBuilt the Dbu-rtse Rnying-pa Gtsug-lag-khang.\nCalligraphed a golden Bka'-'gyur."@en .

bdr:NT0F975F3BC7C73801
   a             bdo:Note ;
   bdo:contentLocationStatement  "p. 2285" ;
   bdo:noteSource  bdr:MW26372 ;
   bdo:noteText  "1216. sa skya'i rje btsun grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis <<bstan rtis>> mdzad cing mi ring bar sku gshegs"@en .

