bdr:NTC72A35971C6C7693
   a             bdo:Note ;
   bdo:contentLocationStatement  "p. 49" ;
   bdo:noteSource  bdr:MW28065 ;
   bdo:noteText  "one of the disciples of sa chen kun dga' snying po; he belonged to the group known as the \"bzod pa thob pa bdun\"\n\nthe third of the five patriarchs of the sa skya tradition (sa skya gong ma rnam lnga)\ngsung 'bum in 4 volumes.\nbuilt the dbu rtse rnying ma gtsug lag khang\ncalligraphed a golden bka' 'gyur\n\nwritings: lam 'bras brgyud pa'i gsol 'debs/ brtag gnyis kyi 'grel pa dag ldan/ rgyud gsum gyi mngon rtogs rin po che'i ljon shing/ rgyud sde'i dum bu brgya bcu gsum pa/ stong thun sa bcad/ rje btsun sa skya pa chen po'i rnam thar/ slob dpon rin po che'i rnam thar tshigs bcad ma/ rje btsun nyid kyi mnal lam gyi rnam thar/ rgyud 'bum gyi dkar chag/ bla chen mal gyi chos skor gyi dkar chag/ kyai rdo rje'i chos skor gyi dkar chag/ tshar gsum khug pa'i man ngag/ kyai rdo rje'i mngon rtogs yan lag drug pa/ ba ri lo tsA ba'i lugs kyi kyai rdor dpa' gcig/ mngon rtogs yan lag drug pa/ dad ston rdo rje grags la gdams pa/ kyai rdor las bzhi'i sbyin sreg gi cho ga/ rdo rje bdag med ma'i mngon rtogs/ lam 'bras brgyud pa'i gsol 'debs chung ba gcig/ kyai rdo rje'i dkyil 'khor bkra shis/ dus tha ma'i cho ga/ kyai rdo rje'i bstod pa daN+Da ka/ bdag med ma'i bstod pa dang de'i sa bcad/mi g.yo sngon po la bstod pa/ rdo rje gur gyi sa bcad/ 'grel pa gur rgyan/gur gyi thig gi gsal byed/ ku ru ku l+le'i sgrub thabs/ dpal he ru ka'i chas drug/ rdor dril gyi mtshan nyid/ de nyid gsum pa/ bla ma lnga bcu pa'i TI ka/ rtsa ltung gi 'grel pa 'khrul pa spong ba/ dpal he ru ka'i byung tshul/ bde mchog lU hi pa'i sgrub thabs/ nag po pa'i dkyil chog gi 'grel pa/ nag po pa'i dkyil chog/ nag po gzhung drug gi sa bcad/ dril bu pa'i lo rgyus dang sgrub thabs/ las bcu'i gdams ngag/ tshogs mchod mdor bsdus/ sman chen po'i bcud len/rdzogs rim rtsa dbu ma'i khrid yig/ rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi bstod pa/ spyod rgyud gzhan phan spyi chings/ kun rig gi cho ga gzhan phan 'od zer/ 'jam dbyangs kyi bstod pa rgyud gsum 'khor lo/ 'jam dpal mtshan brjod 'don thabs/ bsrung pa bri tshul/ phyag na rdo rje'i gzungs kyi man ngag rgyas par bshad pa/ las tshogs nyi shu rtsa gcig gi gzhung gi TI ka/ shAkya'i rgyal po'i gdung rabs/ bod kyi rgyal po'i rgyal rabs mdor bsdus pa/ dus tshod nges par bzung ba'i rtsis sogs mang ngo\n\ndharma activities: dbu rtse rnying mar grags pa'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs/ bla ma dkon mchog rgyal po'i nang rten gser gyi gdung khang/ bla ma sa chen gyi nang rten bkra shis sgo mang/ slob dpon rin po che dang gcung gi nang rten gser sku rnams bzhengs"@en .

